+## Fix round 1
+
+Brief `task-11a-fix1-brief.md`, review `task-11a-review.md`. Head `2021f173f`. Probes:
+`/tmp/claude-1000/p61/t11ar/probes/` (reviewer), `/tmp/claude-1000/p61/t11a/probes/{f1,f1c,f1d}/` (mine).
